<title>FINLAND: HUHTAMAKI SURGES ON HERSHEY DEAL.</title>
<headline>HUHTAMAKI SURGES ON HERSHEY DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy surged on Friday on the company's announcement it was swapping confectionery units with U.S. company Herschey .</p>
<p>At 1620/1320 GMT, Huhtamaki's ordinary share traded at 209.00 markka, up 24.00 markka or nearly 13 percent in active dealings.</p>
<p>&quot;Apparently this is popular,&quot; one broker said. &quot;I don't know, I'm just trading.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
